	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "KIM Board breadboard headers: three female socket strips in one line, 2.54mm pitch. Row 1 (1x20) is the 6502 BUS odd pins 1-39, Row 2 (1x20) the even pins 2-40, Select (1x10) GND, IO1B-IO8B, VCC as pads 41-50. Pad n is 6502 BUS pin n for pads 1-40")
